id: ANS-014
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: Missing no_log on secret tasks
category: security
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: password
patterns:
  - regex: no_log:\s*(true|yes)
    message: "Task handles secrets without no_log — credentials will appear in Ansible output"
fix: Add no_log: true to any task that handles passwords, tokens, or secrets. This prevents credentials from appearing in console output and logs.
